    "correct": 1,
    "explanation": {
      "en": "With ÷ meaning subtraction, 10 ÷ 4 becomes 10 − 4 = 6.",
      "as": "÷ ৰ অৰ্থ বিয়োগ হ'লে 10 ÷ 4 এ 10 − 4 = 6 হয়।"
